WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.990
That's gonna be trouble!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.630
Enchu...

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.750
<b>Article 12 
Swallows in the Wind</b>

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.380
That's right.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.760
The tastiest prey...

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:57.510
is right there.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.150
Muhyo!

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.530
Muhyo!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.530
Roji-kun!

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.300
Wh-Where am I?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.420
How do you like it?

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:43.550
You're the one who's imprisoned now!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.310
You will spend a long, long time

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:51.100
suffering in our prison before 
you finally become a spirit.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.440
You will become one with us!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.320
N-No!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.820
Muhyo!

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.620
The spectralization has begun...

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.760
Suffer! Writhe in agony!

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.570
Entertain us!

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.730
Is that...

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.820
your closing statement?

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.340
Oh, please...

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.360
You intend to pass a sentence now?

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.600
Just try it!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.600
It's <i>you</i> who will suffer punishment!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.650
Remember, you're in our prison now!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.120
You guys seem to have the wrong idea.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.380
You're the only ones who are in a prison.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.370
We aren't.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.370
<i>What does he mean?</i>

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.400
<i>The Spirit Barrier?</i>

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.780
<i>But my barrier won't be enough...</i>

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.850
<i>And in the situation we're in...</i>

00:03:55.850 --> 00:04:00.130
According to Magical Law Article 325...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.470
Wait, Muhyo!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:10.220
You need to have faith in Muhyo.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.100
After all, you use talismans 
to help him, don't you?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.150
The talismans won't respond 
to a hesitant heart.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.380
<i>Muhyo believes in me...</i>

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.430
<i>So I'll...</i>

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.870
So I'll also...

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.620
Muhyo!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:43.130
<b>Crime: Unsolicited Spectral Fusion</b>

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.030
For the crime of "Unsolicited 
Spectral Fusion,"

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.130
<b>Sentence: Demon-faced Cannonball</b>

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.540
I sentence you to the "Demon-faced Cannonball"!

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:47.440
No way...

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:49.750
Muhyo enforced magical law?!

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.160
Spirit Barrier...

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:07.770
Circle!

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.080
Muhyo!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.120
Roji-kun!

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:22.130
Thank goodness you're both okay!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.380
Roji, how'd you use that circle?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.180
I don't know... I wasn't really thinking.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.310
It was a draw?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.450
Impressive as always, Muhyo.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.880
I'm so glad it worked, though!

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:41.980
Not yet.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.120
I have... to shut him up...

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:51.990
Muhyo?

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:53.080
Muhyo!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.830
Could this be...

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.210
a side effect of the Ren Source Spring?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:03.290
It must be! Because he drank it all at once!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.590
Damn it!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.090
We have to get him treated 
at the Association!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:13.240
You look awfully exhausted, Muhyo.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.980
This time... Yes!

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:55.140
Who are you?

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:58.890
<i>Madoka-sama!</i>

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:01.650
What is it?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.400
I've caught a pesky little bug.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.470
She dared to get in my way.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:11.290
Now... How shall I cook her up?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.160
Don't do anything pointless.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.180
B-But...

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.680
<i>Return here.</i>

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.420
Your life is spared for now.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:30.950
Imai-san! Imai-san!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.430
Imai-san!

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:45.030
This is frustrating...

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.640
You seem displeased.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:48.460
Yeah...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.450
Another freaky thing showed up!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.300
And my ren's running low, too...

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.620
We're really up against the wall, aren't we?

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.710
Muhyo...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.060
Bico, give me some of that potion, too!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.790
Something's wrong with Teacher!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.840
She's on her way to spectralizing.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.870
It can still be stopped, but...

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.840
Losing her now was not part of my plan.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.350
We'll return to treating her.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.970
Without killing them?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.360
But that's such a shame...

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.030
Let's kill them!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.170
Stop!

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:51.550
I could easily kill Muhyo 
now if I so desired.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.610
But simply having him die 
would be far too boring.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.560
I won't have it!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.900
Very well.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:20.090
I won't allow things to end like this, Muhyo.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.580
But..

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.830
This betrayal has truly been a great thing.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.170
Teacher!

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.090
It gave me quite a thrill.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.840
It did end in failure...

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.760
Damn it!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.340
And while I feel for you, Bico,

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.350
this plan could not have gone better.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.060
Damn you!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.440
Next time, as well...

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.280
Just as your friends interfered with me,

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.280
my fellow forbidden magical law users

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.840
will come to take your happiness.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:03.020
To uphold my plan,

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:08.170
they'll eagerly devour your precious 
friends and all you hold dear!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.170
I won't let that happen!

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:16.550
I won't let you take anything!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.700
We'll protect it all together!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.430
Rio-sensei!

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:28.330
I swear we'll come to save you!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.940
So, until then...

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:34.940
Until then...

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.950
Teacher...

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.560
Please...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.220
Please, be all right...

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.200
Please!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.810
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.520
Magical Law Hospital

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.630
I understand how you feel,

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:29.030
but hearing these bells in such close 
proximity can affect your health.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:34.540
If you insist on staying, please wear these.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.300
Thank you.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.850
Is Roji okay in there?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.100
I don't think it'll hurt him that much.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.470
The ren bells that the healers use

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:58.610
Ren Bells

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:56.830
are magical tools that restore ren 
by drawing fatigue out of the body,

00:11:56.830 --> 00:12:00.070
so they do cause insomnia in 
some people, but that's all.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:04.200
Still, we only just got back, you know?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.740
Indeed.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.280
Kusano's devotion to 
Muhyo-dono is unbelievable.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:16.210
I think it's more unbelievable that 
you survived that fire, personally.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.380
Hmph! You say that like
I'm some kind of monster.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.890
Who are you?!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.260
My Muhyo!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.510
What? What's going on?!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.680
Page...

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.330
Director-General...

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.820
Thank goodness.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.270
I'm sorry! So sorry!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.340
Honestly.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.280
Sorry... Sorry...

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.280
He actually woke up!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.350
Wait!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.360
That guy's the executor you work for?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.150
Yeah.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:53.410
And shockingly enough, he's Muhyo's teacher.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.630
What?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.540
Good to meet you, Kusano-kun. 
I've heard much about you.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.550
Uh... Yes, sir...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:06.300
My name is Page Klaus. 
I am but an old executor.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:09.370
I appreciate all you've done
 for Muhyo and Yoichi.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.060
Oh, I haven't...

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:24.650
Forgive me for bringing bad news 
when you've only just awakened.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:29.910
The forbidden magical law users who were acting 
individually have begun to work together.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.640
And just days ago,

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:35.290
this was delivered to the 
Investigations Bureau.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.540
I can't believe they took 
the time to make this...

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.470
It's a list of people to kill.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.220
<b>Muhyo Toru</b>

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.120
<i>People to kill?!</i>

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.100
How can this be?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.560
Each one has such detailed information...

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.310
<b>Page Klaus</b>

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.770
<b>Imai Reiko</b>

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.330
Birthplaces, current address, 
family structure...

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.690
<b>Himukai Yoichi</b>

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.310
<b>Kusano Jiro</b>

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:01.300
Even physical characteristics!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.350
Muhyo and I are here, and 
so are Roji and Bico.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.950
Most are important figures 
in the world of magical law,

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.070
and those close to them.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:15.020
Some of the forbidden magical law 
users are former magical lawyers.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.210
They're the source of the leaks.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:21.260
The objective of the list is simple.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:22.630
It's a declaration.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.770
They're saying, "We could kill 
you tomorrow if we wanted."

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.680
I'm sure their methods 
would be brutal, as well.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.400
It wouldn't be a clean death.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.940
One of their members is someone 
who makes me believe that.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.200
One whose face is hidden behind a mask,

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:42.160
who lurks in darkness and devours the light.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.230
A mask?

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.400
A mask with four eyes?!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.640
You've met him?

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:50.280
Yeah. A creepy guy who wears 
a mask with four eyes.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.120
His name is...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.620
Tiki.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.970
I've heard of him!

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:03.750
My history textbook mentioned a mysterious, 
elusive character called Tiki.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.880
I'm not surprised that's all a 
textbook would say about him.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.850
In reality, he is a traitor

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:14.600
who has been marked by
 the Association for 800 years.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.790
Every time there's a major 
magical law incident,

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:21.270
he shows up, finds a way to 
meddle, and then disappears.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.060
M-Meddle?

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.120
Some say forbidden magical 
law has made him immortal,

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.740
while others say he's a ghost.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.880
There's no end to the rumors about him.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.780
Hmph.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:36.160
Tiki is treated as confidential, and 
you're spilling everything about him.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.660
What's got you in such a panic, old man?

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:43.670
Goodness. I suppose I can't hide
 anything from you, Muhyo.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.700
After what happened at the magic prison,

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:49.370
the Association finally 
roused itself into action.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.570
Preparations will soon begin
 for a clean-up operation

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:57.390
to apprehend all of the 
forbidden magical law users,

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.240
including Enchu and Rio-kun.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.020
A clean-up operation sounds well and good,

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.770
but I'm sure you know what that means.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.860
Here you go. Right in here.

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:17.910
You guys!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.660
Teacher Bico!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.610
We were so worried!

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.780
There, there.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.670
I'm sorry, guys.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.280
Who are those kids?

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.790
Bico's students.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.170
Well, then...

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.050
I'll be going now.

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:36.220
No smoking in the hospital!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.680
<b>No Smoking in the Hospital</b>

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.160
Oh... Muhyo!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:43.690
I don't suppose you'd let 
me handle Enchu, would you?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:47.690
No Smoking

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.680
You can't handle him, you old fart.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.820
I expected that,

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:55.070
but honestly, why must both my 
students be so out of control?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.100
Both? You don't mean...

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.800
He does.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.580
Director-General Page

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.220
taught magical law to both Muhyo and Enchu.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:07.080
One, two... One, two...

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.230
So tired...

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.500
Magical law calls for 
basic physical fitness!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.840
After this, we'll all recite poetry!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.590
One, two... One, two...

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.090
What?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.610
<b>My Journal!!</b>

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.610
<b>Private</b>

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.610
<i>Teacher...</i>

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.150
<b>Private</b>

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.220
<b>My Journal!!</b>

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.290
<i>I'm sorry for writing in your journal.</i>

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.110
<b>Teacher, 
I'm sorry for writing in your journal.</b>

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:42.620
<i>The raspberries seem to have 
survived the fire, somehow.</i>

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:47.620
<i>I'll take care of them, Teacher, 
so that when you come back...</i>

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:52.130
We can pick raspberries together.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.500
Right! Starting tomorrow, it's back to work!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:01.140
Magical Law Hospital

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.450
You need rest until the Ren Source 
Spring's poison wears off.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:03.690
It'll take about three more days.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:04.650
Fine.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.140
Well, then, goodnight.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:11.310
Huh? Was that dresser here before?

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.030
Hmm?

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.020
Oh, nothing.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.690
Damn it, Roji!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:31.420
You saw through my super papier 
mâché technique, huh?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.920
Idiot.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.670
But I'm just so worried about you.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.690
And I have so many questions...

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.800
Hey, Muhyo, is there really a way
 to undo forbidden magi—

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:44.790
Shut up.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.180
Yeah... That's what I thought.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:52.770
I was actually saving 
this method for him...

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:58.460
You really do intend to 
save Enchu, don't you?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:04.540
Sorry. I knew you'd never tell 
me if I didn't say it first.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.170
All right! I'll get even stronger!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.870
I'm part of the reason you've 
struggled so much with all this.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.410
I need to do better.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.600
I'll start by learning how
 to use talismans...

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.220
No... First, I'll...

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:27.470
If you get it, you should've 
just stayed quiet.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.200
Just can't contain yourself, can you?

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.380
Idiot.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.450
<b>A Few Days Later</b>

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:48.200
Muhyo, are you sure you're fully recovered?

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:52.710
I do still have a headache, 
thanks to Bico's shoddy potion.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:55.580
That's what you get for drinking
 the whole thing!

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:56.730
Say what?

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:59.280
My Ren Source Spring is perfect!

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.760
Now, now, you two...

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:00.680
Whatever, moron!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.720
Just let these little runts be, Roji.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.140
Tell Nana-chan I said hi!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.800
S-Sure...

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:10.390
Man, I wish I could go with you 
and feel those E-cups again!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.690
Hey, I know! I'll call her!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.910
Hi, Nana-chan! How've you been?

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:16.320
What's up? Where are you?

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.140
What? The bureau?

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.280
Wait, the bureau?

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.740
Nana-chan?

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.240
<b>Muhyo Bureau of
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.240
Roji-kun?

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.550
Where the heck are you?

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:28.220
You both disappeared without a word.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.240
What? You're coming back?

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.710
Why are you at the bureau, Nana-chan?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.440
W-Well, I couldn't leave it unattended!

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:37.730
I've been keeping an eye on it for you.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:41.600
<i>That's weird... I'm sure 
we locked the door...</i>

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.720
Hey, Onion! Bean Sprout!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.220
Don't forget to bring back souvenirs!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.790
Is that... Kenji?!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.600
Muhyo!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.650
Wait!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:55.900
Well, Nana-chan...

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.320
See you later.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:06.530
I'll contact you as soon as I find 
out where Rio-sensei is!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.200
Okay! And we'll all go save her together!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.290
No matter what!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:56.120
You didn't want to see them 
again before they left?

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.840
Like two little swallows...

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:00.710
Huh?

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:03.480
Look at them.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:07.940
They're like swallows 
flying against the wind.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:15.780
Go. Make your own destiny.
